# These TSVs are byte-exact golden artefacts: figure1_digitization.json records
# their sha256, and python/tests/test_digitize_spx_wilmott.py asserts both that
# digest and that the digitizer regenerates the exact committed bytes. The repo
# has core.autocrlf=true, which hands a fresh checkout CRLF copies whose digests
# match nothing -- found the first time the atx-vol Python suite ran gated
# (lane PY, 2026-10-23). `-text` stores and restores them verbatim, exactly as
# atx-vol/tests/data/nav-sections-rel-avx2/.gitattributes does for its dumps.
*.tsv -text
